{"lesson":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7v5ofuqx","courseId":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","order":41,"title":"Wo ist der Bahnhof?","nativeTitle":"Where Is the Train Station?","focus":"","level":"","fromLang":"English","toLang":"German","targetLanguage":"de-DE","nativeLanguage":"en-US","speakers":["Nico","Sebastian","Lisa","Emma"],"speakerGenders":{"Nico":"male","Sebastian":"male","Lisa":"female","Emma":"female"},"sentences":[{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Vielen Dank für die Sachen. Ich gebe sie dir bald zurück , ja?","native":"Thank you very much for the things. I'll give them back to you soon, okay?"},{"speaker":"Sebastian","target":"Gerne, Nico. Die zwei T-Shirts und die Hose kannst du behalten . Die Tasche und die Jacke brauche ich unbedingt zurück.","native":"Gladly, Nico. You can keep the two T-shirts and the pants. I definitely need the bag and the jacket back."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Auf jeden Fall. Danke!","native":"Definitely. Thanks!"},{"speaker":"Sebastian","target":"Ja! Oh, schon zehn Uhr. Ich muss unbedingt noch etwas für unseren Urlaub einkaufen. Lisa, was brauchen wir? Sonnencreme, Saft …","native":"Yes! Oh, it's already ten o'clock. I absolutely have to buy something for our vacation. Lisa, what do we need? Sunscreen, juice …"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Wo kaufst du ein?","native":"Where are you shopping?"},{"speaker":"Sebastian","target":"Ich kaufe im Supermarkt um die Ecke ein.","native":"I'm shopping at the supermarket around the corner."},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Ja, dann bring doch bitte noch Wasser mit.","native":"Yes, then please bring some water too."},{"speaker":"Sebastian","target":"Okay!","native":"Okay!"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Emma?","native":"Emma?"},{"speaker":"Emma","target":"Ja?","native":"Yes?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Ich habe ein Geschenk für dich!","native":"I have a present for you!"},{"speaker":"Emma","target":"Echt?","native":"Really?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Mhm!","native":"Mhm!"},{"speaker":"Emma","target":"Cool! Dein Bild!","native":"Cool! Your picture!"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Ja, für dich!","native":"Yes, for you!"},{"speaker":"Emma","target":"Ich habe auch ein Geschenk für dich. Hier, ein Notizbuch. Für alle neuen Wörter auf Deutsch. Und Seifenblasen!","native":"I have a present for you too. Here, a notebook. For all the new words in German. And soap bubbles!"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Danke, Emma!","native":"Thanks, Emma!"},{"speaker":"Emma","target":"Wo wohnst du jetzt?","native":"Where do you live now?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Ich wohne bei Frau Kohlhaas. Sie ist sehr nett und wohnt in der Kälberstraße.","native":"I live with Mrs. Kohlhaas. She is very nice and lives on Kälberstraße."},{"speaker":"Emma","target":"Kälberstraße? Wo ist das?","native":"Kälberstraße? Where is that?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Hier, da!","native":"Here, there!"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Da ist der Friedensplatz. Da arbeiten Max und Tarek. Ich arbeite neben dem Theater. Und die Kälberstraße ist in der Nähe vom Restaurant und der Sprachschule.","native":"There is Friedensplatz. Max and Tarek work there. I work next to the theater. And Kälberstraße is near the restaurant and the language school."},{"speaker":"Emma","target":"Und hier ist die Polizeistation. Hier arbeitet Opa.","native":"And here is the police station. Grandpa works here."},{"speaker":"Emma","target":"Opa!","native":"Grandpa!"}],"teach":null,"wordData":null,"progress":{"teach":false,"full":false,"practice":null},"createdAt":1795063529489,"updatedAt":1795063529521},"course":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","name":"Nicos Weg","level":"","from":"","to":"German","createdAt":1795063529520,"custom":true},"pack":{"v":1,"lines":{"0":{"f":"Vielen Dank für die Sachen. Ich gebe sie dir bald zurück , ja?","fn":"Thank you very much for the things. I'll give them back to you soon, okay?"},"1":{"f":"Gerne, Nico. Die zwei T-Shirts und die Hose kannst du behalten . Die Tasche und die Jacke brauche ich unbedingt zurück.","fn":"Gladly, Nico. You ca